binomialMinimalPrimes -- minimal primes of a binomial Ideal
***********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        binomialMinimalPrimes I
  * Inputs:
      * I, a binomial ideal
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
