        pd_pd_rp, => ..., default value false, generate informative output
  * Outputs:
      * the list of minimal primes of I

Description
===========

The binomial minimal primes of a binomial ideal over QQ exist only in extension
fields.
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y,z]                               |
|                                                 |
|o1 = R                                           |
|                                                 |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                              |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = ideal(y^3,y^2*z^2-x^3,x*y^2*z,x^3*z-x*y)|
|                                                 |
|             3   2 2    3     2    3             |
|o2 = ideal (y , y z  - x , x*y z, x z - x*y)     |
|                                                 |
|o2 : Ideal of R                                  |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : binomialMinimalPrimes I                     |
|                                                 |
|o3 = {ideal (y, x)}                              |
|                                                 |
|o3 : List                                        |
+-------------------------------------------------+
If the option *note Verbose: (Macaulay2Doc)Verbose, is set (default), then
