idealFromCharacter -- Generate a lattice ideal from a character.
****************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        idealFromCharacter (R, rho)
  * Inputs:
      * R, a ring to contain the output ideal
      * rho, a *note partialCharacter: partialCharacter,
  * Outputs:
      * the lattice ideal corresponding to rho

Description
===========

+------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y]                                |
|                                                |
|o1 = R                                          |
|                                                |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                             |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = ideal(x^3-1,y-x)                       |
|                                                |
|             3                                  |
|o2 = ideal (x  - 1, - x + y)                    |
|                                                |
|o2 : Ideal of R                                 |
