makeBinomial -- make a binomial from an exponent vector and a coefficient
*************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        makeBinomial (R,m,c)
  * Inputs:
      * R, a ring
      * m, a vector of exponents, one for each generator of R
      * c, an element of the coefficient ring of R
  * Outputs:
