|i1 : R = QQ[x,y,z]                  |
|                                    |
|o1 = R                              |
|                                    |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                 |
+------------------------------------+
|i2 : makeBinomial (R, [1,-1,-2], 10)|
|                                    |
|            2                       |
|o2 = - 10y*z  + x                   |
|                                    |
|o2 : R                              |
